    "Suggested On means the boosted target window, including valve timing offsets. Relay On means observed demand; it does not guarantee heat flow.": "Navržené zapnutí je zvýšený cíl s posuny ventilů. Relé ukazuje požadavek, ne zaručené teplo.",
